<title>USA: Leap Group sets buyback plan.</title>
<headline>Leap Group sets buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leap Group Inc said it plans to buy back up to 1 million shares.</p>
<p>Under the program, the cost of the program has been capped at $3 million, the company said.</p>
<p>Leap said it plans to repurchase the shares on the open market or in negotiated transactions. The repurchased shares are to be held as treasury shares and will be available for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>(-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610)</p>
